    {
      "q": "Which agencies buy from Cgi Federal?",
      "a": "The General Services Administration, the Department of Health and Human Services, and the Department of Justice are the top buyers of Cgi Federal work in FY2027 to date. Those agencies obligated $33.8M, $31.9M, and $21.7M respectively. Other buyers this year include the Department of Veterans Affairs at $7.5M and the Department of Transportation at $6.2M."
    },
    {
      "q": "What does Cgi Federal sell to the government?",
      "a": "Cgi Federal sells primarily Computer Systems Design Services to the government, totaling $65.4M in FY2027 to date. Cgi Federal also provides Facilities Support Services at $15M and Other Computer Related Services at $14.8M, with additional work in Computing Infrastructure Providers at $6.2M and R&D in the physical and engineering sciences at $323K."
